A '''trawler''' was a type of [[Starship|ship]]. [[Unidentified Hutt trawler|One]] trawler was operated by the [[Hutt Clan]] during the [[High Republic Era]], and towed the [[Ro family]]'s [[Unidentified Theelin family's ship|ship]] to [[Nar Shaddaa]].<ref name="Path of Deceit">''[[The High Republic: Path of Deceit]]''</ref>

